KZ2 patch 7023: native macOS SPU portability.

Written for the Pyrrhus native Mac bring-up; no game code or RPCS3 code used.
Licence: MIT (project LICENSE).
6083: audio and LFQueue use existing POSIX wrappers; cellPad loads SDL3's dylib.
7023: exact SPU helpers keep the caller FPCR when no native RZ mode is supplied;
lock profiling uses the ARM virtual counter on AArch64, TSC on x86, or a
monotonic nanosecond clock elsewhere (diagnostic ticks, not CPU cycles).
Host validation: native synthetic boot and full patch-series application;
see docs/BUILDING.md. No game run performed.

